<view class="help-page"><view class="help-body"><view class="help-stage"><text>元享帮助中心</text><view>每一步，<text>都为你说明白。</text></view><yx-icon name="support" tone="light" size="154"/></view><scroll-view scroll-x="true" scroll-into-view="help-tab-{{activeCategory}}" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false" class="help-category-scroll"><view class="help-categories"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" id="help-tab-{{item.id}}" class="{{activeCategory===item.id?'active':''}}" data-category="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseCategory">{{item.label}}</view></view></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{activeCategory!=='all'}}" class="help-topic-card"><text>{{activeTopic.label}}说明</text><text>{{activeTopic.intro}}</text><navigator url="{{activeTopic.path}}">{{activeTopic.action}} <yx-icon name="arrow" tone="brand" size="24"/></navigator></view><view class="faq-list"><view wx:for="{{visibleQuestions}}" wx:key="id" class="faq-item {{expanded===item.id?'open':''}}"><view class="faq-heading" bindtap="toggleQuestion" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text>{{item.number}}</text><text>{{item.question}}</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="26"/></view><view wx:if="{{expanded===item.id}}" class="faq-content"><text>{{item.answer}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.tip}}" class="faq-tip">{{item.tip}}</text></view></view></view><view class="help-more"><text>还没有找到答案？</text><text>微信客服会协助你核对具体情况</text></view></view><view class="help-footer-spacer"></view><view class="help-footer"><button class="ui-primary" open-type="contact"><yx-icon name="support" tone="light" size="40"/>联系微信客服</button></view></view>
